# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# The pages below were indexed under the previous documentation site (flat
# .html files at the root). Keep them reachable: an indexed URL that 404s costs
# more than the redirect does.
# The old site published its sitemap at /sitemap.xml and that URL is what
# Search Console has had on file since 2026-06-24. Astro emits
# /sitemap-index.xml instead, so the registered URL started 404ing the moment
# this site went up. Same rule as the pages below.
#
# Targets carry a trailing slash. Astro emits directory-style pages and the
# asset server answers the slashless form with a 307 to the slashed one, so a
# target written without the slash turned every legacy URL into two hops.
